# Industry Pain Points

## 1. Fragmented Data Landscape
- Multiple legacy systems (ERP, MES, PLM, E/E tools)
- No unified data model
- High manual effort for data extraction

## 2. Tool Chaos & Silo Structures
- Redundant tools across departments
- No end-to-end ownership
- Slow decision-making processes

## 3. Lack of AI Readiness
- Missing data quality standards
- No feature stores
- No clear AI governance

## 4. Organizational Barriers
- Fear of transparency
- Political decision-making
- Low willingness to change

## 5. Missing ROI Evaluation
- No systematic use-case scoring
- Projects started without value assessment
